<DATE>
<TIME>
$PROB TGI LLC, GOMPERTZ SIM FROM tg102b   P:tg102b  F:BASE
$INPUT ID TIME DV MDV
$DATA ../../data/tgi-llc.csv IGNORE=@
$PRED
  V0   = 1
  ALPH = THETA(1) * EXP(ETA(1))
  BETA = THETA(2) * EXP(ETA(2))
  F    = V0 * EXP(ALPH / BETA * (1 - EXP(-BETA * TIME)))
  IPRE = F
  W    = SQRT(THETA(3)**2 + THETA(4)**2 * IPRE**2)
  IF (W.LT.1E-6) W = 1E-6
  Y    = IPRE + W * EPS(1)

$THETA
  0.747116 FIX
  0.0814564 FIX
  37.5435 FIX
  0.0896454 FIX

$OMEGA BLOCK(2) FIX
  0.0319908
  0.0446543  0.0639156

$SIGMA 1 FIX

$SIM (20260917) ONLYSIMULATION SUBPROBLEMS=200

$TAB ID TIME DV MDV
     ONEHEADER NOPRINT NOAPPEND FILE=simtab
  
NM-TRAN MESSAGES 
  
 WARNINGS AND ERRORS (IF ANY) FOR PROBLEM    1
             
 (WARNING  2) NM-TRAN INFERS THAT THE DATA ARE POPULATION.
  
Note: Analytical 2nd Derivatives are constructed in FSUBS but are never used.
      You may insert $ABBR DERIV2=NO after the first $PROB to save FSUBS construction and compilation time
  
  
License Registered to: <LICENSEE>
Expiration Date: <DATE>
Current Date: <DATE>
Days until program expires : <N>
